---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = "Piper Inns Hall";
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <p>
  Interested in <strong>systems programming</strong> and developer tooling.
  Working primarily in <strong>Rust</strong> for low-level systems,
  <strong>Lua</strong> for developer tooling, and Java. Currently pursuing
  Computer Science studies and seeking impactful roles where I can apply
  rigorous problem-solving skills.
  </p>
  <p>
  My interests range from theoretical foundations of type systems and
  <strong>lambda calculus</strong>, to building <strong>performance-critical
    software</strong> and contributing to real-world infrastructure. I enjoy
  diving deep into how systems work, optimizing for speed, understanding
  tradeoffs, and translating abstract concepts into practical implementations
  that solve real problems.
  <p>
  Based in Wellington, New Zealand. I contribute to open source when I find
  something worth building, and I'm always looking to understand systems from
  the ground up. Feel free to reach me via
  <a href="mailto:piper.innshall@gmail.com" style="color:#60a5da; text-decoration: underline;">piper.innshall@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
